---
// IndustryApplications.astro
// High-density entity network: AS9100D, NADCAP, ASTM E1417, ASTM E112, ISO 13485, FDA 21 CFR Part 820,
// ASTM F86, ISO 10993, SEMI F20, ASTM A967, Ra ≤ 0.2 µm, 10⁻⁹ Torr — regulatory compliance cross-index
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Titanium Industry Applications | Aerospace, Medical, Semiconductor & Energy"
  description="Cross-industry compliance frameworks for titanium CNC machining: AS9100D aerospace with ASTM E1417 NDT, ISO 13485 medical with ISO 10993 biocompatibility, SEMI F20 semiconductor UHV with electropolishing Ra ≤ 0.2 µm."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-24 max-w-5xl">
    <nav class="text-sm mb-8 text-zinc-400"><a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a> / <a href="/resources" class="hover:text-white">Resources</a> / <span class="text-white">Industry Applications</span></nav>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Titanium CNC Machining — Industry Applications &amp; Compliance Frameworks</h1>
    <p class="text-xl mb-12 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Comprehensive overview of industry-specific compliance frameworks and regulatory standards governing titanium CNC machining across aerospace, medical, semiconductor, marine, energy, and industrial equipment sectors.</p>

    <!-- Section 1: Aerospace & Defense Compliance -->
    <article class="mb-12 p-8 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Aerospace &amp; Defense Compliance — AS9100D &amp; NADCAP Gating</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">Manufacturing titanium components for aerospace propulsion and structural airframes requires absolute adherence to the <strong>AS9100D</strong> quality management standard and <strong>NADCAP</strong> special process accreditations. When CNC-machining critical elements like aircraft engine bulkheads or dynamic rotor heads from Grade 5 titanium, the process must mitigate micro-structural damage induced by high thermal stresses. BOZE strictly controls the surface integrity by enforcing specialized milling parameters that eliminate the formation of the brittle alpha-case layer, ensuring zero micro-cracks.</p>
      <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">All high-stress fasteners and structural brackets undergo non-destructive testing (NDT), including liquid penetrant inspection per <strong>ASTM E1417</strong> and digital radiography to detect subsurface discontinuities. Microstructural verification guarantees that the grain size conforms perfectly to <strong>ASTM E112</strong> standards, securing maximum fatigue life under extreme cyclic aerodynamic loading. Full EN 10204 3.1 material traceability and AS9102 First Article Inspection reports accompany every aerospace lot.</p>
    </article>

    <!-- Section 2: Medical & Biomedical Devices -->
    <article class="mb-12 p-8 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Medical &amp; Biomedical Devices — ISO 13485 &amp; FDA Title 21 CFR Part 820</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">For long-term human implants such as orthopedic bone screws, trauma plates, and dental implant abutments, production must comply with <strong>ISO 13485</strong> and <strong>FDA Title 21 CFR Part 820</strong> quality system regulations. Utilizing Grade 23 ELI (Extra Low Interstitials) titanium, BOZE deploys specialized multi-axis CNC Swiss Lathes operating inside controlled cleanroom zones. To ensure absolute biocompatibility, our production protocol enforces a strict <strong>zero-contamination workflow</strong>, completely banning all lubricants containing heavy metals, chlorine, or sulfur.</p>
      <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">Post-machining surface treatments strictly follow <strong>ASTM F86</strong> surface preparation guidelines. Components undergo an automated multi-stage deionized water ultrasonic cleaning validation lifecycle to eliminate organic hydrocarbon micro-residues, guaranteeing compliance with <strong>ISO 10993</strong> biocompatibility, non-cytotoxicity, and bio-burden thresholds before sterile packaging.</p>
    </article>

    <!-- Section 3: Semiconductor & Ultra-High Vacuum -->
    <article class="mb-12 p-8 rounded-xl" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Semiconductor &amp; Ultra-High Vacuum — SEMI F20 &amp; UHV Standards</h2>
      <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">Titanium components integrated into semiconductor gas delivery networks, matrix chambers, and ultra-high vacuum (UHV) systems must align precisely with the <strong>SEMI F20</strong> specification. The critical metric here is eliminating gas desorption outgassing pathways and preventing chemical reactions with corrosive precursor gases. BOZE machines these specialized vacuum components under strict temperature-controlled environments to hold tolerances within <strong>0.01 mm</strong>.</p>
      <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);">Following machining, components undergo specialized electropolishing (EP) and chemical passivation protocols per <strong>ASTM A967</strong>, yielding an ultra-smooth internal surface finish with a roughness value of <strong>Ra ≤ 0.2 µm</strong>. This crystalline surface refinement effectively eliminates microscopic pits and structural crevices, preventing volatile fluid stagnation nodes and ensuring high-purity vacuum integrity under <strong>10⁻⁹ Torr</strong> operating conditions.</p>
    </article>

    <!-- Cross-Reference Industry Links -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Cross-Reference — Industry Application Nodes</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
      <a href="/industries/aerospace" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Aerospace — AS9100D</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Titanium structural brackets, bulkheads, engine components under AS9100D with EN 10204 3.1 MTR and AS9102 FAIR.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/medical" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Medical — ISO 13485:2016</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Grade 23 ELI bone screws and orthopedic implants with zero-contamination ultrasonic cleaning and ISO 10993 compliance.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/semiconductor" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Semiconductor — UHV &amp; Class 100</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Ultra-precision vacuum chambers and gas showerheads for 10⁻⁹ Torr with ISO Class 5 cleanroom packaging.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/marine" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Marine — NACE SP0198</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Grade 12 Ti-0.3Mo-0.8Ni subsea enclosures with hydrostatic testing and crevice corrosion mitigation.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/energy" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Energy — H₂ &amp; Nuclear SMR</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Hydrogen compressor impellers with H ≤ 0.0125%. Nuclear CRDM with shot peening for +300% fatigue life.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/uav-drones" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">UAV — Lightweight Engineering</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Thin-wall titanium to 0.5 mm for gimbal mounts and rotor hubs. Dynamic balancing per ISO 1940 G2.5.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/ai-infrastructure" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">AI Infrastructure — 800G/1.6T</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Thin-wall EMI shielding enclosures for optical transceivers with low-CTE titanium thermal drift elimination.</p></a>
      <a href="/industries/industrial-equipment" class="p-8 rounded-xl block hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Industrial Equipment</h3><p class="text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">Ultrasonic sonotrodes with FEA-verified 20-40 kHz tuning. Grade 7 Ti-0.12Pd reactor valves.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
